    <div class="col-md-6 .col-s-12 p-5">
      <p class="align-text-middle">An IQ test is a standardized assessment that measures your cognitive abilities, including reasoning, problem-solving, and spatial awareness. IQ scores are typically distributed as follows:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><b>130+</b> : Gifted - Exceptional potential</li>
        <li><b>115-129</b> : Strong analytical skills</li>
        <li><b>85-114</b> : Solid cognitive abilities</li>
        <li><b>70-84</b> : Areas for cognitive growth</li>
        <li><b>69 or below</b> : Reflects opportunities for growth</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="btn-container">
        <%= link_to "Discover your giftedness →", first_question_path, class: "btn btn-flat" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
